  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthened institutional capacity of workers&apos; organizations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This CPO will support the Confederation of Trade Unions of Armenia (CTUA) and its affiliates in modernizing their structures and internal governance as well as their services to stimulate representativeness for all workers including displaced persons  facing risks of exploitation. ILO will also assist CTUA in upgrading its services for workers including by making use of digital technologies to report labour law violations from the workplaces and effectively address them in cooperation with the labour market institutions.</narrative>
  </description>
